# Governance Decision Trees (Mermaid Diagrams)

## 1. Agent Deployment Decision Tree

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🚀 Agent Deployment Request"] --> B{"Target<br/>Environment?"}
    
    B -->|Development| C["✅ Auto-Approve<br/>agent_operator"]
    B -->|Staging| D{"Change<br/>Type?"}
    B -->|Production| E{"Risk<br/>Level?"}
    
    D -->|Security| F["Require<br/>security_reviewer"]
    D -->|Non-Security| G["Require<br/>agent_operator"]
    
    E -->|Low| H["Level 1: agent_operator<br/>+ 1 reviewer"]
    E -->|Medium| I["Level 1: agent_operator<br/>+ security_reviewer"]
    E -->|High| J["Multi-Level: agent_op<br/>+ security + ci_op"]
    
    C --> K["🟢 Deploy<br/>Immediately"]
    F --> L["⏳ Start Approval<br/>Workflow"]
    G --> L
    H --> L
    I --> L
    J --> L
    
    L --> M{"Decision:<br/>All Approve?"}
    M -->|Yes| K
    M -->|No| N["❌ Deployment<br/>Blocked"]
    
    style K fill:#90EE90
    style N fill:#FFB6C6
    style L fill:#FFE4B5
```

## 2. Secret Rotation Decision Tree

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🔐 Secret Rotation Request"] --> B{"Emergency<br/>Situation?"}
    
    B -->|Yes| C["🚨 Incident Mode<br/>30-min SLA"]
    B -->|No| D["📋 Standard Mode<br/>2-hour SLA"]
    
    C --> E["Require<br/>system_admin<br/>approval"]
    D --> F["Require<br/>security_reviewer +<br/>system_admin"]
    
    E --> G["⏳ Start Approval<br/>with Escalation"]
    F --> G
    
    G --> H{"Approved<br/>within SLA?"}
    H -->|Yes| I["🟢 Rotate<br/>Secret"]
    H -->|No| J{"Escalate?"}
    
    J -->|Yes| K["📈 Escalate to<br/>Senior Authority"]
    J -->|No| L["❌ Rotation<br/>Rejected"]
    
    K --> M{"Senior<br/>Approve?"}
    M -->|Yes| I
    M -->|No| L
    
    I --> N["Update All<br/>Services"]
    N --> O["✅ Complete"]
    
    style I fill:#90EE90
    style L fill:#FFB6C6
    style O fill:#90EE90
```

## 3. Approval Escalation Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["📋 Approval Request<br/>Submitted"] --> B["⏱️ L1 SLA: 4 hours"]
    
    B --> C{"L1 Approver<br/>Responds?"}
    
    C -->|Approved| D["✅ Approved<br/>Proceed"]
    C -->|Rejected| E["❌ Rejected<br/>Block"]
    C -->|No Response| F["⏳ L1 SLA Expired"]
    
    F --> G["Escalate to L2"]
    G --> H["⏱️ L2 SLA: 4 hours<br/>Secondary Reviewer"]
    
    H --> I{"L2 Approver<br/>Responds?"}
    I -->|Approved| D
    I -->|Rejected| E
    I -->|No Response| J["⏳ L2 SLA Expired"]
    
    J --> K["Escalate to L3"]
    K --> L["⏱️ L3 SLA: 4 hours<br/>Senior Authority"]
    
    L --> M{"L3 Approver<br/>Responds?"}
    M -->|Approved| D
    M -->|Rejected| E
    M -->|No Response| N["🤖 Auto-Approve<br/>Quorum Unavailable"]
    
    N --> O["✅ Approved<br/>Proceed"]
    D --> P["🎯 Action<br/>Proceeds"]
    E --> Q["🛑 Action<br/>Blocked"]
    O --> P
    
    style P fill:#90EE90
    style Q fill:#FFB6C6
```

## 4. RBAC Permission Check

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🔍 Permission Check<br/>user_id, action, resource"] --> B{"User has<br/>required role?"}
    
    B -->|No| C["❌ Permission<br/>Denied"]
    B -->|Yes| D{"Role has<br/>action for<br/>resource?"}
    
    D -->|No| C
    D -->|Yes| E{"Action<br/>is dangerous?<br/>DELETE, APPROVE"}
    
    E -->|Yes| F["🔒 Require explicit<br/>approval"]
    E -->|No| G["✅ Permission<br/>Allowed"]
    
    F --> H{"Approval<br/>granted?"}
    H -->|Yes| G
    H -->|No| C
    
    C --> I["Log security event"]
    G --> J["Log audit trail"]
    I --> K["Return 403"]
    J --> L["Return 200"]
    
    style G fill:#90EE90
    style C fill:#FFB6C6
```

## 5. Token Validation & Refresh

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🎫 API Request with<br/>Access Token"] --> B{"Token<br/>Valid?"}
    
    B -->|No| C["❌ 401 Unauthorized"]
    B -->|Yes| D{"Token<br/>Expired?"}
    
    D -->|No| E["✅ Request<br/>Processed"]
    D -->|Yes| F{"Refresh Token<br/>Available?"}
    
    F -->|No| G["❌ 401 Unauthorized<br/>Re-authenticate"]
    F -->|Yes| H["Refresh<br/>Access Token"]
    
    H --> I{"Refresh<br/>Successful?"}
    I -->|No| G
    I -->|Yes| J["✅ Request<br/>Processed"]
    
    C --> K["Return Error"]
    G --> K
    E --> L["Continue"]
    J --> L
    
    style E fill:#90EE90
    style J fill:#90EE90
    style G fill:#FFB6C6
    style C fill:#FFB6C6
```

## 6. Auto-Approval Decision

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["📋 Check Auto-Approval<br/>Conditions"] --> B{"Requester has<br/>all required<br/>roles?"}
    
    B -->|No| C["❌ No Auto-Approval<br/>Need approvers"]
    B -->|Yes| D{"Policy allows<br/>auto-approval?"}
    
    D -->|No| C
    D -->|Yes| E{"Operation is<br/>dangerous?<br/>DELETE, APPEND"}
    
    E -->|Yes| F["❌ No Auto-Approval<br/>Too risky"]
    E -->|No| G["✅ Auto-Approve<br/>Fast-track"]
    
    C --> H["Start approval<br/>workflow"]
    F --> H
    G --> I["Proceed<br/>immediately"]
    
    style G fill:#90EE90
    style C fill:#FFE4B5
    style F fill:#FFE4B5
    style H fill:#FFE4B5
```

## 7. Scope Assignment Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["👤 User Login<br/>with Roles"] --> B["system_admin?"]
    
    B -->|Yes| C["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:*, governance:*,<br/>admin:*"]
    B -->|No| D["agent_operator?"]
    
    D -->|Yes| E["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:agents:*<br/>api:workflows:exec<br/>governance:audit"]
    D -->|No| F["ci_operator?"]
    
    F -->|Yes| G["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:workflows:*<br/>governance:audit"]
    F -->|No| H["security_reviewer?"]
    
    H -->|Yes| I["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:workflows:approve<br/>api:secrets:read<br/>governance:approve"]
    H -->|No| J["doc_maintainer?"]
    
    J -->|Yes| K["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:docs:*"]
    J -->|No| L["agent_reader?"]
    
    L -->|Yes| M["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:agents:read<br/>api:workflows:read<br/>governance:audit"]
    L -->|No| N["guest?"]
    
    N -->|Yes| O["Assign Scopes:<br/>api:public:read"]
    
    C --> P["Issue Token<br/>with Scopes"]
    E --> P
    G --> P
    I --> P
    K --> P
    M --> P
    O --> P
    
    P --> Q["✅ Token Ready<br/>for API Calls"]
```

## 8. Multi-Role Authorization Check

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Check Multi-Role<br/>Permission"] --> B{"User has<br/>AGENT_OPERATOR?"}
    
    B -->|No| C["❌ Denied<br/>Missing deploy role"]
    B -->|Yes| D{"User has<br/>CI_OPERATOR OR<br/>SECURITY_REVIEWER?"}
    
    D -->|No| E["❌ Denied<br/>Missing approval role"]
    D -->|Yes| F["✅ Approved<br/>Has both roles"]
    
    C --> G["Log denial"]
    E --> G
    F --> H["Proceed with<br/>operation"]
    
    style F fill:#90EE90
    style C fill:#FFB6C6
    style E fill:#FFB6C6
```

## 9. Incident Mode Escalation

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🚨 Incident Mode<br/>Activated"] --> B["Request Approval"]
    
    B --> C["⏱️ Expedited: 30-min SLA"]
    
    C --> D["Level 1<br/>Primary Authority<br/>30 minutes"]
    
    D --> E{"L1 Approves<br/>within 30 min?"}
    
    E -->|Yes| F["✅ Approved<br/>Execute"]
    E -->|No| G["Skip L2<br/>Go to L3"]
    
    G --> H["Level 3<br/>Senior Authority<br/>30 minutes"]
    
    H --> I{"L3 Response<br/>within 30 min?"}
    
    I -->|Approved| F
    I -->|Rejected| J["❌ Rejected"]
    I -->|No Response| K["🤖 Auto-Approve<br/>Incident Override"]
    
    K --> L["✅ Approved<br/>Execute"]
    
    F --> M["🎯 Execute Action<br/>Immediately"]
    J --> N["🛑 Block Action"]
    L --> M
    
    style F fill:#90EE90
    style L fill:#90EE90
    style J fill:#FFB6C6
```

## 10. Compliance & Audit Trail

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["⚙️ Action with<br/>RBAC Check"] --> B["✍️ Log Decision"]
    
    B --> C["📋 Audit Event<br/>timestamp, user_id,<br/>role, action,<br/>resource, result"]
    
    C --> D{"Action<br/>Allowed?"}
    
    D -->|Yes| E["✅ Proceed"]
    D -->|No| F["❌ Block"]
    
    E --> G["Execute<br/>Action"]
    F --> H["Return Error"]
    
    G --> I["✍️ Log Result"]
    H --> I
    
    I --> J["Store in<br/>Audit Log<br/>90-day retention"]
    
    J --> K["Available for<br/>Compliance<br/>Review & Audit"]
    
    style E fill:#90EE90
    style F fill:#FFB6C6
    style K fill:#87CEEB
```

---

## Legend

| Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| 🚀 | Start/Deployment |
| 🔐 | Security-related |
| 🔍 | Check/Validation |
| ⏳ | Waiting/In Progress |
| 📋 | Request/Record |
| ✅ | Success/Approved |
| ❌ | Failure/Denied |
| 🛑 | Blocked |
| 📈 | Escalation |
| 🤖 | Automatic |
| 🎯 | Action/Execution |

## Color Scheme

- **Green (#90EE90):** Success/Approved states
- **Pink (#FFB6C6):** Failed/Denied states
- **Orange (#FFE4B5):** Pending/Waiting states
- **Blue (#87CEEB):** Information/Audit states

